### BE-001 API examples (VS Code REST Client / Rider / Visual Studio .http)
### Start the API first: dotnet run --project BC-LocalAI/BC-LocalAI.csproj --launch-profile http
@host = http://localhost:5290

### 1) Valid message -> 200 {"response":"<answer>","model":"qwen3:4b"} (needs Ollama running)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "สวัสดี AI" }

### 2) Empty message -> 400 INVALID_MESSAGE
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "" }

### 3) Whitespace only -> 400 INVALID_MESSAGE
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "   " }

### 4) Missing field -> 400 INVALID_MESSAGE
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5) Malformed JSON -> 400 INVALID_MESSAGE
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ bad json

### 6) Wrong type -> 400 INVALID_MESSAGE
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": 123 }

### 7) Streaming message -> SSE started, delta(s), completed (needs Ollama running)
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{ "message": "หนึ่งบวกหนึ่งเท่ากับเท่าไร ตอบสั้น ๆ เป็นภาษาไทย" }
